(5786400, 842794, 102534, '<td valign="top">cool, i was gonna try something like this. Glad i didnt, I dont think it would have been as strong as this is. Not too keen on the flow of sugar or is it salt coming down in one column, so think it would work better with a tight crop just at the top of the brolly IMHO. Still worth an 8. great work</td>', 'cool, i was gonna try something like this. Glad i didnt, I dont think it would have been as strong as this is. Not too keen on the flow of sugar or is it salt coming down in one column, so think it would work better with a tight crop just at the top of the brolly IMHO. Still worth an 8. great work', '2009-12-30 00:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5786511, 842164, 108525, '<td valign="top">I love everything about this photo except for the noise.</td>', 'I love everything about this photo except for the noise.', '2009-12-30 01:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5786512, 842487, 15511, '<td valign="top">Bravo!</td>', 'Bravo!', '2009-12-30 01:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
