(5786537, 842705, 102024, '<td valign="top">Well that looks like an awesome place to take photos, but there are a lot of elements in this photo that clash for me, and I see no reason for that.  I think the umbrella could have benefited from another light source to give it more color perhaps.</td>', 'Well that looks like an awesome place to take photos, but there are a lot of elements in this photo that clash for me, and I see no reason for that.  I think the umbrella could have benefited from another light source to give it more color perhaps.', '2009-12-30 01:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5786540, 842796, 102024, '<td valign="top">Aw, sad... what a waste of a perfectly good umbrella... =)</td>', 'Aw, sad... what a waste of a perfectly good umbrella... =)', '2009-12-30 01:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5786547, 842794, 102024, '<td valign="top">Since the composition is so bold, and there really is only two elements in this photograph, I actually think I would prefer a slightly faster shutter speed to maintain a little more definition in the water.</td>', 'Since the composition is so bold, and there really is only two elements in this photograph, I actually think I would prefer a slightly faster shutter speed to maintain a little more definition in the water.', '2009-12-30 01:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
