(5786706, 842487, 19474, '<td valign="top">You are lucky to have this sculpture for this challenge<br/>but that said your photograph is masterfully done<br/>the man, dog and fog with the near monotone look all add to the overall effect<br/>my only wish is for a foot of clearance above the top of the poles<br/>my top score by a good margin</td>', 'You are lucky to have this sculpture for this challengebut that said your photograph is masterfully donethe man, dog and fog with the near monotone look all add to the overall effectmy only wish is for a foot of clearance above the top of the polesmy top score by a good margin', '2009-12-30 07:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
