(5786725, 842794, 71239, '<td valign="top">Bumping up.  Plenty of drink umbrellas in this challenge, but mostly static/pattern shots.  You''ve gone a stage further with the falling water (or could it be salt/sugar?) and that deserves a higher mark for increased effort resulting in a better image.</td>', 'Bumping up.  Plenty of drink umbrellas in this challenge, but mostly static/pattern shots.  You''ve gone a stage further with the falling water (or could it be salt/sugar?) and that deserves a higher mark for increased effort resulting in a better image.', '2009-12-30 08:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
