(5788151, 842487, 109478, '<td valign="top">Excellent atmospheric photo! The umbrellas are cool and beautiful. The fog keeps the backgroud clean and adds mood. The man and the dog are very nice for composition. The photo would be not so good without them. If the umbrellas are black, I would consider it a set in Theo Angelopoulos''s movie.<br/> <br/>I think this photo has the potential to be a classic, so I give it 10(and definitly my blue ribbon). This is my first time to give 10!</td>', 'Excellent atmospheric photo! The umbrellas are cool and beautiful. The fog keeps the backgroud clean and adds mood. The man and the dog are very nice for composition. The photo would be not so good without them. If the umbrellas are black, I would consider it a set in Theo Angelopoulos''s movie. I think this photo has the potential to be a classic, so I give it 10(and definitly my blue ribbon). This is my first time to give 10!', '2009-12-31 01:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788152, 842681, 97225, '<td valign="top">Love the bright red and the line of mannequins, who seem to have personalities. They make the perfect foil for the umbrella obscured and anonymous pedestrian.</td>', 'Love the bright red and the line of mannequins, who seem to have personalities. They make the perfect foil for the umbrella obscured and anonymous pedestrian.', '2009-12-31 01:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
