(5788866, 842787, 111808, '<td valign="top">How delightfully whimsical - a Winter Umbrella Tree. Very creative and executed quite well indeed.</td>', 'How delightfully whimsical - a Winter Umbrella Tree. Very creative and executed quite well indeed.', '2009-12-31 21:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788867, 842489, 111808, '<td valign="top">The multiple lines are very engaging in this against the white background and are echoed by their own shadows. Very simple concept, great execution.</td>', 'The multiple lines are very engaging in this against the white background and are echoed by their own shadows. Very simple concept, great execution.', '2009-12-31 21:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788870, 841983, 111808, '<td valign="top">The contrasts of orange against green are very effective in this as is the star point of view against the octagonal centre. Clean lines &amp; subtly shaded colours make an engaging &amp; superb photograph.</td>', 'The contrasts of orange against green are very effective in this as is the star point of view against the octagonal centre. Clean lines & subtly shaded colours make an engaging & superb photograph.', '2009-12-31 21:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788873, 842164, 8178, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but I am seeing a TON of noise. Was it shot at high ISO?</td>', 'Interesting, but I am seeing a TON of noise. Was it shot at high ISO?', '2009-12-31 21:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788875, 842705, 8178, '<td valign="top">Love this! Very unusual and creative. Love the perspective, and the umbrella is placed well on the rule of thirds.</td>', 'Love this! Very unusual and creative. Love the perspective, and the umbrella is placed well on the rule of thirds.', '2009-12-31 21:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788876, 842007, 111808, '<td valign="top">A different but beautiful interpretation of the challenge - the suspended droplet with the half reflection is just superb. I like how the rest of drops are rolling down the curled yellow petal while the variegated bloom underneath is sheltered. The line/shapes in this are exquisite, both seperate and blended.</td>', 'A different but beautiful interpretation of the challenge - the suspended droplet with the half reflection is just superb. I like how the rest of drops are rolling down the curled yellow petal while the variegated bloom underneath is sheltered. The line/shapes in this are exquisite, both seperate and blended.', '2009-12-31 21:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788877, 842776, 8178, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting, but I am not a huge fan of selective coloring in general, although I know you were trying to put the emphasis on the umbrella. Or wait, was it not selective coloring?</td>', 'It''s interesting, but I am not a huge fan of selective coloring in general, although I know you were trying to put the emphasis on the umbrella. Or wait, was it not selective coloring?', '2009-12-31 21:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788878, 842136, 8178, '<td valign="top">I like the high key look, but I wish the snow wasn''t blown.</td>', 'I like the high key look, but I wish the snow wasn''t blown.', '2009-12-31 21:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788879, 841588, 8178, '<td valign="top">Love the setup, I''d be curious to know how you did this. Not loving the red rusty post-processing effect though.</td>', 'Love the setup, I''d be curious to know how you did this. Not loving the red rusty post-processing effect though.', '2009-12-31 21:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788880, 842039, 111808, '<td valign="top">I like how you cannot see the human except from the knees down as the blue jeans and shoeless feet make a great contrast with the white brolly. Clearly in motion but with no rain, so it is a mechanism of obfuscation here but it IS effective &amp; engaging. The white high-key background adds to this a lot also.</td>', 'I like how you cannot see the human except from the knees down as the blue jeans and shoeless feet make a great contrast with the white brolly. Clearly in motion but with no rain, so it is a mechanism of obfuscation here but it IS effective & engaging. The white high-key background adds to this a lot also.', '2009-12-31 21:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788881, 842036, 8178, '<td valign="top">Love the expression! I would recrop to put her eyes on the thirds, and also your black and white conversion looks a little bit muddy.</td>', 'Love the expression! I would recrop to put her eyes on the thirds, and also your black and white conversion looks a little bit muddy.', '2009-12-31 21:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788882, 842483, 111808, '<td valign="top">While the gold tones of this provide a feeling of warmth, it takes a good eye to spot the natural umbrellas of the ''shrooms. Perhaps these are Faery Brolleys...Linear reinforcement in this is superb.</td>', 'While the gold tones of this provide a feeling of warmth, it takes a good eye to spot the natural umbrellas of the ''shrooms. Perhaps these are Faery Brolleys...Linear reinforcement in this is superb.', '2009-12-31 21:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788883, 842726, 8178, '<td valign="top">It''s cute, but she is looking out of the frame (makes you wonder what she is looking at), her hand is chopped off, and the image is a little soft on the girl. Looks like the focus fell on the umbrella (maybe you were trying to do that, but it doesn''t work)</td>', 'It''s cute, but she is looking out of the frame (makes you wonder what she is looking at), her hand is chopped off, and the image is a little soft on the girl. Looks like the focus fell on the umbrella (maybe you were trying to do that, but it doesn''t work)', '2009-12-31 21:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788885, 842796, 8178, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of selective coloring. I''d crop in closer, there is too much going on in the background and makes it look snapshooty.</td>', 'Not a fan of selective coloring. I''d crop in closer, there is too much going on in the background and makes it look snapshooty.', '2009-12-31 21:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788886, 842487, 8178, '<td valign="top">Love this one! Very moody and foggy. It works!</td>', 'Love this one! Very moody and foggy. It works!', '2009-12-31 21:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788888, 841588, 99710, '<td valign="top">very very creative. 10</td>', 'very very creative. 10', '2009-12-31 21:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788889, 842725, 8178, '<td valign="top">Her skin is very heavy on yellow and not enough magenta, and also a little bit hot in places. The hand is chopped off, and not digging her expression. Nice otherwise! 6</td>', 'Her skin is very heavy on yellow and not enough magenta, and also a little bit hot in places. The hand is chopped off, and not digging her expression. Nice otherwise! 6', '2009-12-31 21:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788891, 842821, 8178, '<td valign="top">Love the pose and the black and white. Too contrasty and the whites are blown.</td>', 'Love the pose and the black and white. Too contrasty and the whites are blown.', '2009-12-31 21:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788892, 842796, 111808, '<td valign="top">The very selective desaturation in this draws the eye directly to the pink apparently discarded brolley, then the curved path takes you farther to the children, one of whom has a colourful jacket while the tones of the father''s slacks mimic the colours of the empty bench. The passerby way way in the distance has just a hint of pink pants too completing the circle. Lines are supreme in this - the trash can, the benches, the pathways, the bridge,the upright trees in the Park - all echoing and reinforcing the whole composition but it takes careful study to realise this. Superb &amp; understated.</td>', 'The very selective desaturation in this draws the eye directly to the pink apparently discarded brolley, then the curved path takes you farther to the children, one of whom has a colourful jacket while the tones of the father''s slacks mimic the colours of the empty bench. The passerby way way in the distance has just a hint of pink pants too completing the circle. Lines are supreme in this - the trash can, the benches, the pathways, the bridge,the upright trees in the Park - all echoing and reinforcing the whole composition but it takes careful study to realise this. Superb & understated.', '2009-12-31 21:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788893, 842039, 8178, '<td valign="top">I like this. The feet are heavy on magenta, I''d like to see them warmed up, otherwise, nice shot. 9</td>', 'I like this. The feet are heavy on magenta, I''d like to see them warmed up, otherwise, nice shot. 9', '2009-12-31 21:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788894, 841675, 111808, '<td valign="top">This resonates with just the subtlest touches of sadness. I like it very much.</td>', 'This resonates with just the subtlest touches of sadness. I like it very much.', '2009-12-31 21:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788896, 842787, 8178, '<td valign="top">Nice! The sky is too bright/blown.</td>', 'Nice! The sky is too bright/blown.', '2009-12-31 21:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788897, 842288, 8178, '<td valign="top">She looks more annoyed to be there rather than sad. Maybe it''s because her pose is light and airy, and so is her outfit and the white umbrella, but the face is not. It would be better if the whole shot set the mood, not just the out-of-place runny makeup. Also, I''d like to see more DOF to separate her from the background.</td>', 'She looks more annoyed to be there rather than sad. Maybe it''s because her pose is light and airy, and so is her outfit and the white umbrella, but the face is not. It would be better if the whole shot set the mood, not just the out-of-place runny makeup. Also, I''d like to see more DOF to separate her from the background.', '2009-12-31 21:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788898, 842136, 111808, '<td valign="top">The starkness of black and white works very well for this. I like the upturned umbrella bowl catching the fragile dusting of the snow.</td>', 'The starkness of black and white works very well for this. I like the upturned umbrella bowl catching the fragile dusting of the snow.', '2009-12-31 21:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788901, 842751, 111808, '<td valign="top">Love the brilliant metallic colours in this and the shapes of the repeating circles and arcs of circles. The snowflake designs on the mini-brolleys also provide a nice touch.</td>', 'Love the brilliant metallic colours in this and the shapes of the repeating circles and arcs of circles. The snowflake designs on the mini-brolleys also provide a nice touch.', '2009-12-31 21:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788905, 842776, 111808, '<td valign="top">I would not have ever thought to use a brolley as a birdfeeder (and it might provide a semblance of shelter as well to the winged creatures of the Earth)so that is a creative out of the box idea. This pretty blue bowled brolley is in great contrast to the rest of the stark snowy landscape. This is a great &amp; unique Winter composition.</td>', 'I would not have ever thought to use a brolley as a birdfeeder (and it might provide a semblance of shelter as well to the winged creatures of the Earth)so that is a creative out of the box idea. This pretty blue bowled brolley is in great contrast to the rest of the stark snowy landscape. This is a great & unique Winter composition.', '2009-12-31 21:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788906, 842820, 111808, '<td valign="top">Definitely a unique sideways point of view. The rainbow colours in this are beautiful as are the predominently blue water ripples.</td>', 'Definitely a unique sideways point of view. The rainbow colours in this are beautiful as are the predominently blue water ripples.', '2009-12-31 22:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788909, 842822, 111808, '<td valign="top">Red-Blue-Green tri-colour scheme is simple but highly effective in this composition. The tones are brilliant and the contrasts not only of hue but of semi-straight curves against the curled ivy. Very nice, definitely eyecatching.</td>', 'Red-Blue-Green tri-colour scheme is simple but highly effective in this composition. The tones are brilliant and the contrasts not only of hue but of semi-straight curves against the curled ivy. Very nice, definitely eyecatching.', '2009-12-31 22:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788910, 841323, 111808, '<td valign="top">Well done execution here of a simple concept which could well prove very hard to capture correctly.</td>', 'Well done execution here of a simple concept which could well prove very hard to capture correctly.', '2009-12-31 22:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788912, 841746, 111808, '<td valign="top">The kinetic energy and movement in this is fantastic - all the brilliant colours, shapes and lines blur together like wet watercolours. Abstract, understated and engaging.</td>', 'The kinetic energy and movement in this is fantastic - all the brilliant colours, shapes and lines blur together like wet watercolours. Abstract, understated and engaging.', '2009-12-31 22:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788921, 842272, 111808, '<td valign="top">It took me a few moments to realise where the umbrella was in this composition when it came up - my first impression of it was that it was a form of octagonal black stop sign - which slowed the viewing down so as to study it. By definition a portal is a doorway or entrance which is usually imposing and this fits quite well. I like the rest of the photograph also - the cloudscape &amp; the reflection in the water; the textures of the earthen road leading up to the bridge and the lines of the backstop &amp; guardrails.<br/>I would go where this beckons.</td>', 'It took me a few moments to realise where the umbrella was in this composition when it came up - my first impression of it was that it was a form of octagonal black stop sign - which slowed the viewing down so as to study it. By definition a portal is a doorway or entrance which is usually imposing and this fits quite well. I like the rest of the photograph also - the cloudscape & the reflection in the water; the textures of the earthen road leading up to the bridge and the lines of the backstop & guardrails.I would go where this beckons.', '2009-12-31 22:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788928, 841713, 111808, '<td valign="top">Odd, unique juxtapositions in this composition. It is a very different point of view, the smooth &amp; colourful brolley against the shadowed half man &amp; the broken down house but it feels out of place and time, jarring somehow. What is the umbrella sheltering and why? Is this a forgotten attic somewhere in a house left to ruin? What is the backstory of the occupant(s) who once lived here and where did they go? Lots of curious questions, not many obvious answers here.</td>', 'Odd, unique juxtapositions in this composition. It is a very different point of view, the smooth & colourful brolley against the shadowed half man & the broken down house but it feels out of place and time, jarring somehow. What is the umbrella sheltering and why? Is this a forgotten attic somewhere in a house left to ruin? What is the backstory of the occupant(s) who once lived here and where did they go? Lots of curious questions, not many obvious answers here.', '2009-12-31 22:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788934, 842705, 111808, '<td valign="top">Prepared for rain as well he should be since his stand-in building has no roof to shelter him from the elements. Whimsical rainbow umbrella against the stark black almost silhouetted gentleman. The sky does not look like inclement weather is on the way and yet with the swirling clouds who can be quite sure? The graffiti on the shell adds a note of whimsy to the summoning wizard whose coat has caught the wind. This invites study as it is not as simple as first appears. I do like it.</td>', 'Prepared for rain as well he should be since his stand-in building has no roof to shelter him from the elements. Whimsical rainbow umbrella against the stark black almost silhouetted gentleman. The sky does not look like inclement weather is on the way and yet with the swirling clouds who can be quite sure? The graffiti on the shell adds a note of whimsy to the summoning wizard whose coat has caught the wind. This invites study as it is not as simple as first appears. I do like it.', '2009-12-31 22:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788938, 842487, 86447, '<td valign="top">I hate the border... but the photo is so strong it overcomes it.   10 from me.<br/> <br/>So perfect.</td>', 'I hate the border... but the photo is so strong it overcomes it.   10 from me. So perfect.', '2009-12-31 22:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788939, 842599, 86447, '<td valign="top">8 from me... ''Cause this just makes me FEEL!</td>', '8 from me... ''Cause this just makes me FEEL!', '2009-12-31 22:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788943, 842013, 86447, '<td valign="top">Yep.  A 10.  All the way.  Sooo unique and interesting and fun and ... well... perfect.<br/> <br/>In fact, I''m amazed.</td>', 'Yep.  A 10.  All the way.  Sooo unique and interesting and fun and ... well... perfect. In fact, I''m amazed.', '2009-12-31 22:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5788945, 842136, 86447, '<td valign="top">A 9 from me.  This just SINGS!</td>', 'A 9 from me.  This just SINGS!', '2009-12-31 22:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
