(5792758, 842776, 113353, '<td valign="top">an abused technique often, but here is really intriguing</td>', 'an abused technique often, but here is really intriguing', '2010-01-03 09:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792762, 842487, 113353, '<td valign="top">great mood and composition</td>', 'great mood and composition', '2010-01-03 09:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792780, 842487, 33379, '<td valign="top">this looks like something out of the twilight zone.  great capture!</td>', 'this looks like something out of the twilight zone.  great capture!', '2010-01-03 09:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792966, 842272, 68916, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape, the lighting is stunning.  Not sure about the positioning and the lighting of the umbrella though</td>', 'Beautiful landscape, the lighting is stunning.  Not sure about the positioning and the lighting of the umbrella though', '2010-01-03 11:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792977, 841829, 68916, '<td valign="top">What beautiful fabric designs.  I like the idea very much and like that you incorporated the vendor into the shot.   Maybe could have been even stronger left section (starting with the lay''s chip stand) was excluded from the photo.</td>', 'What beautiful fabric designs.  I like the idea very much and like that you incorporated the vendor into the shot.   Maybe could have been even stronger left section (starting with the lay''s chip stand) was excluded from the photo.', '2010-01-03 11:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793048, 842650, 83313, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems kind of harsh and the road in the background does not do it well, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Lighting seems kind of harsh and the road in the background does not do it well, I''m afraid.', '2010-01-03 11:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793054, 842825, 83313, '<td valign="top">I know what they are, but the title sounds bizarrely rude!</td>', 'I know what they are, but the title sounds bizarrely rude!', '2010-01-03 11:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793060, 842681, 83313, '<td valign="top">The mannequins on the right are watching. Not the male one in the middle of the scene, though. He is too busy trying to pick up the girl mannequin.</td>', 'The mannequins on the right are watching. Not the male one in the middle of the scene, though. He is too busy trying to pick up the girl mannequin.', '2010-01-03 12:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793067, 841829, 83313, '<td valign="top">What a selection, these designs grab my eyes and yank them out of their sockets! A fascinating street shot.</td>', 'What a selection, these designs grab my eyes and yank them out of their sockets! A fascinating street shot.', '2010-01-03 12:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793074, 841675, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit, and good colors, but it''s just not grabbing my attention any. A bit of ISO grain as well. The graininess on the clown actually works with the image, but it hurts the background. If this was shot with a point &amp; shoot, you did a great job with what you had.</td>', 'Nicely lit, and good colors, but it''s just not grabbing my attention any. A bit of ISO grain as well. The graininess on the clown actually works with the image, but it hurts the background. If this was shot with a point & shoot, you did a great job with what you had.', '2010-01-03 12:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793080, 842213, 83313, '<td valign="top">An interesting approach, but as a photo of printed material, this is not striking me as an artistic effort.</td>', 'An interesting approach, but as a photo of printed material, this is not striking me as an artistic effort.', '2010-01-03 12:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793090, 842705, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the strong perspective here. Could this be a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=7810" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">coley</a> entry? The color is not usual for him. I will guess that this must be someone else''s.</td>', 'I like the strong perspective here. Could this be a  coley entry? The color is not usual for him. I will guess that this must be someone else''s.', '2010-01-03 12:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793095, 842489, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good shot if the point was simply to illustrate the mechanism, but it''s not having any other impact for me, I''m afraid.</td>', 'A good shot if the point was simply to illustrate the mechanism, but it''s not having any other impact for me, I''m afraid.', '2010-01-03 12:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793103, 841713, 83313, '<td valign="top">Certainly an OOTB effort for you. I like the quirkiness, but you know I like that kind of thing. Hope it''s come up a bit. (No vote, comment only)</td>', 'Certainly an OOTB effort for you. I like the quirkiness, but you know I like that kind of thing. Hope it''s come up a bit. (No vote, comment only)', '2010-01-03 12:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793126, 841884, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good to see Clark again. And Dawg as well. Since I''m aware you have had to store Clark off your property, it makes sense to me, but I don''t think most others are going to understand your title.<br/> <br/>Perhaps you should start fitting Dawg (or is his name Doggie? I foget) into challenges. You could do a lot with that Armadillo. Enter him for a while, and then photograph him putting his boots on with a shoehorn. That will confuse the heck out of people.</td>', 'Good to see Clark again. And Dawg as well. Since I''m aware you have had to store Clark off your property, it makes sense to me, but I don''t think most others are going to understand your title. Perhaps you should start fitting Dawg (or is his name Doggie? I foget) into challenges. You could do a lot with that Armadillo. Enter him for a while, and then photograph him putting his boots on with a shoehorn. That will confuse the heck out of people.', '2010-01-03 12:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793127, 842683, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice, but oversharpened.</td>', 'Nice, but oversharpened.', '2010-01-03 12:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793129, 842776, 83313, '<td valign="top">Quirky, just the way I like ''em.</td>', 'Quirky, just the way I like ''em.', '2010-01-03 12:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793133, 842262, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good try. Credit for creative shoehorning.</td>', 'Good try. Credit for creative shoehorning.', '2010-01-03 12:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793135, 841746, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wonderful blur. One of my favorites so far in this challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful blur. One of my favorites so far in this challenge.', '2010-01-03 12:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793137, 842724, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice textures and the title tells me how it fits the challenge. I''m afraid the photo as a whole is not working for me, however. One issue is that the glare on the shrubs in the upper right pulls my eye away from the main subject.</td>', 'Nice textures and the title tells me how it fits the challenge. I''m afraid the photo as a whole is not working for me, however. One issue is that the glare on the shrubs in the upper right pulls my eye away from the main subject.', '2010-01-03 12:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793141, 842013, 83313, '<td valign="top">Makes an interesting semi-abstract. I had to look for a few seconds to see what the perspective of shot this really was.</td>', 'Makes an interesting semi-abstract. I had to look for a few seconds to see what the perspective of shot this really was.', '2010-01-03 12:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793146, 842809, 83313, '<td valign="top">Love the way you used grain and color. This could be a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=74588" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">cutout</a> entry. If it''s not, then please take that as a compliment.</td>', 'Love the way you used grain and color. This could be a  cutout entry. If it''s not, then please take that as a compliment.', '2010-01-03 12:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793151, 842787, 83313, '<td valign="top">Excellent approach. Is there a shoehorn tree nearby, perchance? This has to be the <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=7810" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Coley</a> entry. Fits the ongoing storyline nicely.</td>', 'Excellent approach. Is there a shoehorn tree nearby, perchance? This has to be the  Coley entry. Fits the ongoing storyline nicely.', '2010-01-03 12:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793315, 842735, 83313, '<td valign="top">An interesting and quirky idea, but the white balance really tosses an unappealing yellow cast on it.</td>', 'An interesting and quirky idea, but the white balance really tosses an unappealing yellow cast on it.', '2010-01-03 14:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793319, 842164, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting and quirky shot. Could be a paper cutout behind those papers. Other than a nitpick for some heavy ISO grain in the foreground, I like this. I have a strong suspicion of who the photographer may be, but I am not certain.</td>', 'Interesting and quirky shot. Could be a paper cutout behind those papers. Other than a nitpick for some heavy ISO grain in the foreground, I like this. I have a strong suspicion of who the photographer may be, but I am not certain.', '2010-01-03 14:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793321, 841709, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like this, but there seems to be a slight yellow cast to it that is keeping the colors from popping like they should.</td>', 'I like this, but there seems to be a slight yellow cast to it that is keeping the colors from popping like they should.', '2010-01-03 14:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793329, 842789, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ve blocked all the farmville notifications on facebook, how did this one sneak through? At least this was not notifying me that you just bought a pig.</td>', 'I''ve blocked all the farmville notifications on facebook, how did this one sneak through? At least this was not notifying me that you just bought a pig.', '2010-01-03 15:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
