(5793779, 842039, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice, though it seems perhaps a little heavy on the NR for my preferences.<br/> <br/>Added: Judging by the style (especially the lighting) I am going to hazard a guess that this is an entry from either <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=99506" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Lutchenko</a> or <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=99448" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Connor</a></td>', 'Nice, though it seems perhaps a little heavy on the NR for my preferences. Added: Judging by the style (especially the lighting) I am going to hazard a guess that this is an entry from either  Lutchenko or  Connor', '2010-01-03 19:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
