(5794856, 842039, 82534, '<td valign="top">You''ve managed to get the white umbrella to stand out against the white background giving a very simple, yet appealing composition.  The contrast of the legs sticking out from beneath actually serve to ground the whole image.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'You''ve managed to get the white umbrella to stand out against the white background giving a very simple, yet appealing composition.  The contrast of the legs sticking out from beneath actually serve to ground the whole image.  Very nicely done.', '2010-01-04 08:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5795000, 842487, 75849, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot!</td>', 'Stunning shot!', '2010-01-04 09:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5795123, 842794, 113332, '<td valign="top">awesome</td>', 'awesome', '2010-01-04 11:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5795380, 842819, 104230, '<td valign="top">Fun idea and composition. The path provides a lovely leading line. However the color adjustment seems overdone and has left what is for me an unnatural pinkish/orange cast to the whole picture.</td>', 'Fun idea and composition. The path provides a lovely leading line. However the color adjustment seems overdone and has left what is for me an unnatural pinkish/orange cast to the whole picture.', '2010-01-04 13:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5795381, 842489, 104230, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The pattern creates an interesting design element.</td>', 'Nice composition.  The pattern creates an interesting design element.', '2010-01-04 13:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5795403, 842288, 104230, '<td valign="top">A great take on the challenge.  I love the contrast of the lighter and more delicate elements against the darker background. One thing that detracts slightly for me is the lightness of the front metal triangular plate which draws my eye away from the main subject. But I can see that placing the model at other points on this walkway might not have worked very well either!!</td>', 'A great take on the challenge.  I love the contrast of the lighter and more delicate elements against the darker background. One thing that detracts slightly for me is the lightness of the front metal triangular plate which draws my eye away from the main subject. But I can see that placing the model at other points on this walkway might not have worked very well either!!', '2010-01-04 13:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5795415, 842820, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely! The slight asymmetry works well too.</td>', 'Lovely! The slight asymmetry works well too.', '2010-01-04 13:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5795425, 842487, 104230, '<td valign="top">What a sculpture. But most of all a very evocative image with the addition of the man and the dog.  Love the image. I think the envelope border detracts rather than adds to it though.</td>', 'What a sculpture. But most of all a very evocative image with the addition of the man and the dog.  Love the image. I think the envelope border detracts rather than adds to it though.', '2010-01-04 14:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
