(5801684, 842809, 54645, '<td valign="top">Like Karen, I didn''t see the face until I read the details! Naturally it won''t go away now...<br/> <br/>It''s bizarre. When I first saw the face, death came to mind, as implied by Steve''s poem, but the flip side is that crazy, energetic joy, kids have running in the rain, getting soaked, fighting the umbrella forced upon them by a well meaning parent. I like it. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-01-07 23:36:22.</i></td>', 'Like Karen, I didn''t see the face until I read the details! Naturally it won''t go away now... It''s bizarre. When I first saw the face, death came to mind, as implied by Steve''s poem, but the flip side is that crazy, energetic joy, kids have running in the rain, getting soaked, fighting the umbrella forced upon them by a well meaning parent. I like it. ', '2010-01-07 23:35:52.000000', '2010-01-07 23:36:22.000000', 0),
