(6044699, 842487, 43463, '<td valign="top">Followed your Life in the City Entry (congrats on the ribbon!) and found your photo that has stuck in my mind but could not remember who the photographer was. To me this captures a mood and feel of a quiet morning; a early stroll when the sights and sounds of the city is asleep so that one can take a stroll in quiet contemplation with only a lone dog as a companion. Love the B&amp;W tones - and I am a sucker for a good umbrella shot (I love umbrellas - owning about 10 - used to be 11 but I lost that one somewhere )</td>', 'Followed your Life in the City Entry (congrats on the ribbon!) and found your photo that has stuck in my mind but could not remember who the photographer was. To me this captures a mood and feel of a quiet morning; a early stroll when the sights and sounds of the city is asleep so that one can take a stroll in quiet contemplation with only a lone dog as a companion. Love the B&W tones - and I am a sucker for a good umbrella shot (I love umbrellas - owning about 10 - used to be 11 but I lost that one somewhere )', '2010-06-07 12:03:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6826049, 842809, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is a treat. Interesting that people didn''t see the umbrella, &amp; the guy who saw ''heavy editing'' made me smile. It must''ve been gratifying to read the emotional reactions your photo stirred. Good work.</td>', 'This is a treat. Interesting that people didn''t see the umbrella, & the guy who saw ''heavy editing'' made me smile. It must''ve been gratifying to read the emotional reactions your photo stirred. Good work.', '2012-07-24 09:20:06.000000', NULL, 0);
